              Request type: Select the appropriate option:



                  Select Request from Member of Parliament if any of the following are on file:


an enquiry from a member of Parliament;

a request from the Office for Client Satisfaction;

a dire needs situation in which the delay in obtaining the T4E is leading to dire financial difficulties (e.g. obtaining food or lodging, repaying an incorrect tax amount, or because a large amount is owed to the client).



Select Payment received in error by our department in all other situations.
